    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h3>SOLD OUT</h3>\n<p>A haunting world of love, deceit and forgiveness awaits with&nbsp;<em>Giselle</em>, a quintessential Romantic work long regarded as “the ballerina’s <em>Hamlet.</em>” Sir Peter Wright’s celebrated staging distills Adolphe Adam’s score into breathtaking choreography and drama.</p>\n<p><em>Giselle</em> is presented by<br><br><img src=\"/media/d3npcbzo/nb2425-giselle-desjardinspresents-black-d.png?rmode=max&amp;width=181&amp;height=40\" alt=\"\" width=\"181\" height=\"40\"></p>"
      }
    ],
