      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<h3>Sold Out</h3>\n<p>Artistic Director Emerita Karen Kain staged and directed her&nbsp;<em>Swan Lake </em>in tribute to a company and ballet that defined her illustrious career. Newly revisited this season, this production emphasizes the drama and beauty that have made <em>Swan Lake </em>the definitive classical work.</p>\n<p><em>Swan Lake</em> is presented by</p>\n<p><img src=\"/media/khxhhxya/nb2425-swanlake-nwpresents-colour.png?rmode=max&amp;width=179&amp;height=50\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"50\"></p>"
      }
    ],
