    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "On Tour: Ottawa"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><strong>Choreography: Bobbi Jene Smith and Or Schraiber</strong></p>\n<h6>On Tour: Ottawa&nbsp;<br>National Arts Centre</h6>\n<p>The November 2025 debut of <em>Procession</em> marked a bold new chapter for The National Ballet of Canada: a first partnership with visionary choreographers Bobbi Jene Smith and Or Schraiber that we are thrilled to present for our annual engagement at Ottawa’s National Arts Centre.</p>"
      }
    ],
