        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "New Work by Jera Wolfe"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><strong>Choreography: Jera Wolfe / Helen Pickett</strong></p>\n<p>One of Canada’s most exciting dancemakers, Jera Wolfe presents his first mainstage work for The National Ballet of Canada alongside Helen Pickett’s <em>Emma Bovary</em>, which returns with new material after the world premiere in 2023.</p>\n<p><em>Kismet / Emma Bovary</em> is presented by<br><br><img src=\"/media/d3npcbzo/nb2425-giselle-desjardinspresents-black-d.png?rmode=max&amp;width=181&amp;height=40\" alt=\"\" width=\"181\" height=\"40\"></p>"
      }
