    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "MADDADDAM"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p><strong>Choreography: Wayne McGregor</strong></p>\n<p>Featuring original music by Max Richter, Wayne McGregor’s&nbsp;<em>MADDADDAM </em>returns to Toronto after a sensational 2022 premiere, with breathtaking visuals and sublime choreography inspired by Margaret Atwood’s novel trilogy, <em>Oryx and Crake</em>, <em>The Year of the Flood </em>and <em>MaddAddam.</em></p>\n<p><em>MADDADDAM</em> is presented by<br><br><img src=\"/media/hmed55wc/nb2425-devo-corporatepartnership-ig-private-wealth-management-b.png?rmode=max&amp;width=171&amp;height=40\" alt=\"\" width=\"171\" height=\"40\"></p>"
      }
    ],
