      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "<p>David Dawson unveils his first original creation for The National Ballet of Canada since being appointed Resident Choreographer by Artistic Director Hope Muir in 2025. Emotionally rich and technically demanding, <em>The Beginning of Forever</em> showcases the dancers at their most expressive, both physically and spiritually.</p>\n<p>Single Tickets on Sale September 22<br>Subscriptions Now on Sale</p>"
